    {
      "id": "cat-half-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 332,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1007,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1007,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Looks up every MLFB from the local TS catalog:\n• Compositional MLFB grammar (verified trunk + slot suffixes)\n• Per-axis motor MLFBs from brake / encoder choices\n• Sums motor power × 0.7 → picks the line module\n• Counts DRIVE-CLiQ cables (modules + 1)\n• Matches MCP to panel size\n• Sizes power and encoder cables to motor current + length\n\n≈ 5,300 distinct orderable MLFBs, all catalog-traceable.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Looks up every MLFB from the local TS catalog:\n• Compositional MLFB grammar (verified trunk + slot suffixes)\n• Per-axis motor MLFBs from brake / encoder choices\n• Sums motor power × 0.7 → picks the line module\n• Counts DRIVE-CLiQ cables (modules + 1)\n• Matches MCP to panel size\n• Sizes power and encoder cables to motor current + length\n\n≈ 5,300 distinct orderable MLFBs, all catalog-traceable.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
